          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> Your prey critically fails on an attack roll against you with a melee Strike.</p>\n<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Your prey is within your reach, you have one free hand, and your target is no more than one size larger than you.</p><hr /><p>You use an opening to capture your prey. You attempt an Athletics check to @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.actionspf2e.Item.Grapple] your prey.</p>"
          },
